    "address": "0xE0011000",
    "firmware_literal_count": 2,
    "note": "0xE0011000 lies inside pib_regs.h rsrvd0[] gap (between core +0x28 and GPIF @0xE0014000). Firmware writes here, but public header gives no field names \u2014 keep semantics candidate/unknown; do not equate to GPIF_CONFIG or socket[].",
